# --- Private, never pushed ---
# Your real resumes, personal info, and proof points
profile/personal-info.md
profile/proof-points.md
profile/resumes-docx/*
profile/resumes-pdf/*
profile/resumes-md/*
!profile/resumes-docx/.gitkeep
!profile/resumes-pdf/.gitkeep
!profile/resumes-md/.gitkeep
profile/cover-letters-docx/*
profile/cover-letters-pdf/*
profile/cover-letters-md/*
!profile/cover-letters-docx/.gitkeep
!profile/cover-letters-pdf/.gitkeep
!profile/cover-letters-md/.gitkeep

# Per-job application data - contains PII (address, veteran status, salary
# answers). Keep this local unless you deliberately strip PII and choose
# to publish a redacted version.
applications/**
!applications/_template.md
# NOTE: the old pattern was `applications/*.md`, which matched only direct
# children and therefore missed every applications/<job>/application.md.
# Corrected 2026-10-02.

# The generated summary table - contains company/role/links which is
# usually fine to share, but defaults to private. Remove this line if you
# want to publish it via GitHub Pages.
TRACKER.md

# Everything else personal that is not under profile/ or applications/
profile-for-agents.md
PLAN.md
profile/linkedin-profile.md
profile/why-repos-are-private.md
profile/CLAIM-AUDIT-*.md
profile/general/**
profile/profile-for-agents.md
profile/linkedin-thumbnails/**
portfolio/**
tracker-site/**
*.png

